{"title":"What should I ask Diarmaid MacCulloch","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/926511890/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Diarmaid-MacCulloch.html","date":1760940853000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him.  He has a <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Lower-than-Angels-History-Christianity/dp/1984878670/ref=sr_1_2?crid=1RA8GN8ENK66P&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.Ra0BZBnjvE6I6jUeXj_792qNi7ktdUQ98U95v5taQdievKpNy4-W7TyW8j1eTKDkwuIISz4cqAMKOPzLqBYhu7DZmfhYdOLnnCfeWhQ6wEQG-hO2ChnXeEatF_qKQWmmovl8fKLH2Mydsa90brLHBw7DeZvzPCS62GhdyhVxFcCygkNH9CvIdXl9G5HU2E0gJNySSxTgVlGdpOEOLiLn4Pe-ZZPk-VWVgF5lc3lahsu0S3kZ17b7F7IRcgvQHhLJ4KVrSLOdVFKAb9_3un__dFUjSrquP5B5EqgJwkUrLKA.Wf4TFu3SXSa_jvHme4N1EIS6yS3RGmtYc380iyyDLwo&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=diarmaid+macculloch&amp;qid=1760886861&amp;sprefix=diarmaid%2Caps%2C380&amp;sr=8-2\" target=\"_blank\">recent book out on the history of sexuality and Christianity</a>, but of course is renowned for<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/s?k=diarmaid+macculloch&amp;crid=1RA8GN8ENK66P&amp;sprefix=diarmaid%2Caps%2C380&amp;ref=nb_sb_ss_p13n-expert-pd-ops-ranker_1_8\" target=\"_blank\"> a much longer series of books and writings</a> on Christianity, the Reformation, and Tudor British history, just for a start.</p>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diarmaid_MacCulloch\" target=\"_blank\">his Wikipedia page</a>.  So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/what-should-i-ask-diarmaid-macculloch.html\">What should I ask Diarmaid MacCulloch</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"h